OL,3,GNEWSAHow can bosses improve workers'
OL,4,Amental health?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving devoted her life to improving
OL,7,Fpeople's mental health after her own
OL,8,Fstruggles, Emily Pearson has set her
OL,9,Fsights on getting businesses to
OL,10,Fprioritise employees' well-being. What
OL,11,Ffive things can a company do?
OL,13,FThursday is World Suicide Prevention
OL,14,FDay, an annual reminder of why
OL,15,Fappreciating mental health is so
OL,16,Fimportant, Emily says.
OL,18,FStress and the significant impact it
OL,19,Fcan have on people needs to be
OL,20,Frecognised by employers, she says.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
